# Copy to <workspace>/.ignore (for example /srv/projects/.ignore).
# ripgrep, which Claude Code's Grep uses, skips these paths in every repository below the workspace,
# even when they are committed. Build output, dependencies and minified files are never business logic,
# and searching them floods the session and spends the user's usage limit.
# Remove a line if a repository keeps real sources under such a folder.
target/
build/
out/
dist/
.gradle/
node_modules/
bower_components/
vendor/
coverage/
.idea/
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.map
*.jar
*.war
*.lock
package-lock.json
